    "description": "1626 Bay Street2500 Square feet Interior900 Square feet of Exclusive Outdoor Decks$9500Spectacular fully renovated all luxury two-level Marina residence for lease. 2500 square feet + 900 square feet of outdoor decks including exclusive roof deck with view for America's cup event.MAIN LEVELLarge Living room with gas fireplace and park view, formal dining, gourmet kitchen, huge private deck with glass rail, guest bedroom & full bath.The all new beautiful kitchen features Viking stainless appliances, black granite counters, Island and custom cabinetry. Kitchen opens to dining room which opens to the 1st of 3 decks.UPPER LEVELTwo Plush Master suites features luxury bath with granite counters, duel sinks and extra closets. The front master suite opens to a Southern view deck. A staircase leads the the private 360 degree Bay View roof deck with glass rails.Hardwood floors, designer finishes, custom lighting, double pained windows throughout.An entertainers dream home located in the coveted Marina district. 12 months then month to month rent control unit.Owner will consider shorter term and pets. Tenants supply credit report with credit score, qualified International tenants welcome."
